  "name": "Pierre Teilhard de Chardin",
  "bio": {
    "type": "/type/text",
    "value": "French philosopher and Jesuit priest who trained as a paleontologist and geologist and took part in the discovery of Peking Man. Teilhard conceived the idea of the Omega Point and developed Vladimir Vernadsky's concept of Noosphere."
